  unitName: Dark Blade Lico
  unitId: 860004
  unitNumber: 8016
  description: Being the daughter of a dark lord, Lico is the only one of the six
    maidens with known ties to Grand Gaia. After a tragic defeat against the gods,
    she deemed her surviving comrades weak and unamusing. Thus, she left to find
    stronger and more worthy companions who could help her and her dark blade find
    a more satisfying experience on the battlefield.
  summonDesc: Are you a worthy companion? <br>Let's see how entertaining you <br>are
    on the battlefield.
  fusionDesc: Surely that's not all? <br>Let's go one more time.
  evoDesc: A new form, eh? Ha ha! <br>What an interesting <br>experience indeed.
